@startuml
title Profile Page — История задач

actor User
participant "ProfilePage" as Page
participant "UserController" as UC
participant "HistoryChallenge" as HC

User -> Page: click "История задач"
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyHistory(page=1, pageSize, search="", status="", language=""))
UC -> HC: findPaginated(userId, status, language, search, page, pageSize)
HC --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: рендер таблицы истории решений

User -> Page: input[поиск] → setHistSearch
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyHistory(page=1, ...search))
UC -> HC: findPaginated(userId, status, language, search, 1, pageSize)
HC --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: отфильтрованная таблица

User -> Page: select[статус] → setHistStatus
User -> Page: select[язык] → setHistLang
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyHistory(page=1, ...filters))
UC -> HC: findPaginated(userId, status, language, search, 1, pageSize)
HC --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: отфильтрованная таблица

User -> Page: click пагинация → setHistPage(n)
Page -> UC: dispatch(fetchMyHistory(page=n, ...))
UC -> HC: findPaginated(userId, status, language, search, n, pageSize)
HC --> UC: rows[], count
UC --> Page: items[], total, totalPages
Page --> User: страница n таблицы

User -> Page: click "Код" на строке истории
Page --> User: открывает модалку с кодом решения

@enduml
